message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DMPE: Deterministic Multi-Criteria Proposer Election (artifact)"
doi: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21730117
authors:
  - family-names: Benarab
    given-names: Massyl
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-9405-3374"
  - family-names: Aoures
    given-names: Younes
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-6551-1294"
abstract: >-
  Artifact for DMPE — a deterministic multi-criteria proposer-election
  preprocessing service for permissioned systems. Includes the pure election
  kernel, observation-aware baselines, correlation-continuum and fallback
  campaigns, multi-engine consumers, multi-container and physical two-host
  determinism results.
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - proposer election
  - permissioned systems
  - deterministic systems
  - Proof-of-Authority
  - multi-criteria decision analysis
